    con "Nemmeno io, in realtà. Credo di avere questo pacchetto da circa un anno."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:212
translate italian connie15_98da17ed:

    # con "Right now, after that, a cigarette hits just right."
    con "In questo momento, dopo tutto quello che è successo, una sigaretta ci sta proprio bene."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:213
translate italian connie15_596c0f44:

    # con "You know, besides my husband, you're the first man I've had sex with in fifty years."
    con "Sai, a parte mio marito, sei il primo uomo con cui ho fatto sesso in cinquant’anni."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:214
translate italian connie15_6a75940e:

    # pc "Really? You and Jackson never had anything?"
    pc "Davvero? Tu e Jackson non avete mai avuto nulla?"

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:215
translate italian connie15_03c8c55b:

    # con "Naw, he's like a brother to me. He's never looked at me like that."
    con "No, per me è come un fratello. Non mi ha mai guardata in quel modo."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:216
translate italian connie15_42e3bab3:

    # con "Nobody ever really looks at me like that."
    con "Nessuno mi guarda mai davvero in quel modo."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:219
translate italian connie15_bab07018:

    # pc "I don't see why not. You're a good looking woman."
    pc "Non vedo perché no. Sei una bella donna."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:220
translate italian connie15_2a7d9ea2:

    # con "I try, but nobody is interested in an old lady."
    con "Ci provo, ma nessuno è interessato a una signora anziana."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:221
translate italian connie15_f0f40b8d:

    # con "You got to use it while you're young, you know? Else you end up stuck in an old body, all alone."
    con "Devi approfittarne finché sei giovane, lo sai? Altrimenti finisci intrappolata in un corpo vecchio, tutta sola."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:222
translate italian connie15_007fbff2:

    # pc "You have regrets?"
    pc "Hai dei rimpianti?"

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:223
translate italian connie15_79491ffd:

    # con "Oh, no. Not really."
    con "Oh, no. Non proprio."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:224
translate italian connie15_bf42fbfd:

    # con "My husband was good to me. We had a lot of really good years."
    con "Mio marito è stato buono con me. Abbiamo trascorso tanti anni davvero felici."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:227
translate italian connie15_8fb15acf:

    # con "And that man was just as gifted as you are in bed."
    con "E quell’uomo era dotato quanto te a letto."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:228
translate italian connie15_acf7a854:

    # con "God, I miss him."
    con "Dio, quanto mi manca."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:231
translate italian connie15_25ac1736:

    # pc "Did you have any children?"
    pc "Hai avuto figli?"

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:232
translate italian connie15_4575dead:

    # con "One. A boy. Chase."
    con "Uno. Un maschio. Chase."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:233
translate italian connie15_5b0fb844:

    # con "He died over in Afghanistan."
    con "È morto in Afghanistan."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:234
translate italian connie15_6c6d9416_1:

    # pc "Oh, I'm sorry."
    pc "Oh, mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:237
translate italian connie15_0fa6aba4_1:

    # con "It's okay."
    con "Va tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:238
translate italian connie15_d075efd8:

    # con "Sometimes I feel like I died too..."
    con "A volte mi sembra di essere morta anch’io..."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:239
translate italian connie15_454cba6d:

    # con "... and I'm just stuck here, waiting for my turn to go meet them."
    con "... e di essere semplicemente bloccata qui, in attesa del mio turno per andare a raggiungerli."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:242
translate italian connie15_19979052:

    # con "Thank you for making me feel alive for a little while."
    con "Grazie per avermi fatto sentire viva per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:243
translate italian connie15_2911487b:

    # con "You're a good kid."
    con "Sei un bravo ragazzo."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:246
translate italian connie15_109a5d63:

    # con "I think you and Brandi make a very nice couple."
    con "Penso che tu e Brandi formiate una coppia davvero carina."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:247
translate italian connie15_68f01008:

    # con "You should consider settling down with her."
    con "Dovresti pensare di sistemarti con lei."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:248
translate italian connie15_19e05b84:

    # con "I see you coming into Jackson's with different girls."
    con "Ti vedo entrare da Jackson's con ragazze diverse."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:249
translate italian connie15_fedfc4a9:

    # con "You're young. That's a good thing. Experiment."
    con "Sei giovane. È una cosa positiva. Sperimenta."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:250
translate italian connie15_ec119d97:

    # con "But eventually, I hope you'll pick a girl and start a life and a family with her."
    con "Ma alla fine, spero che sceglierai una ragazza e inizierai una vita e una famiglia con lei."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:251
translate italian connie15_1dc28a58:

    # con "And I hope you'll make each other very happy."
    con "E spero che vi renderete molto felici a vicenda."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:252
translate italian connie15_a40b7cd5:

    # pc "Thanks, Connie."
    pc "Grazie, Connie."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:253
translate italian connie15_0fd31492:

    # con "All right, that's enough reminiscing. Time to get dressed."
    con "Va bene, basta con i ricordi. È ora di vestirsi."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:256
translate italian connie15_2f1120e6:

    # "Before I leave, she hands me a tin full of chocolate chip cookies."
    "Prima di andarmene, mi porge una scatola piena di biscotti con gocce di cioccolato."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:257
translate italian connie15_189fa119:

    # con "I made these for Jackson, but he can have the next batch. You enjoy. You earned them."
    con "Li ho fatti per Jackson, ma potrà mangiarsi la prossima infornata. Goditeli tu. Te li sei meritati."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:258
translate italian connie15_25e0f073:

    # con "Thanks again for making my day."
    con "Grazie ancora per avermi rallegrato la giornata."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:259
translate italian connie15_a351accf:

    # con "I don't think we'll do this again, but I'm glad to have spent some time with you."
    con "Non credo che lo rifaremo, ma sono felice di aver passato un po’ di tempo con te."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:260
translate italian connie15_a9da76fd:

    # pc "Me too, Connie."
    pc "Anch’io, Connie."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:261
translate italian connie15_c6512378:

    # con "You take care."
    con "Abbi cura di te."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:264
translate italian connie15_18c0b69c:

    # "I leave Connie's house and drive away."
    "Esco da casa di Connie e me ne vado in auto."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:265
translate italian connie15_313c822e:

    # "I hope she'll be okay. She's a sweet lady."
    "Spero che stia bene. È una signora dolcissima."

# game/Scenes/Connie/connie15.rpy:266
translate italian connie15_f74a794a:

    # "And she gives a killer gummer."
    "E dà dei baci da urlo."

